## Limits

This review used Git reads and pure V8 byte/hash/replay and source analysis only. It executed no formatter, Cargo, native test, original checker/helper, h, PTY or ref mutation. It covers the existing selected service and stdio owners, not every SDK protocol/logging tail or daemon OS exit. The other 14 diagnosed sites and final source/metadata union remain separately owned review obligations.
